**Next Steps & Iteration:**

*   Begin with **Phase 1**, focusing on color and typography definitions.
*   Address high-priority items like the **mobile navigation** early in Phase 2.
*   Iterate through components, applying these principles.
*   Continuously review for consistency and overall aesthetic harmony.

This rule will serve as our guide. We can update it as we make decisions or encounter new considerations.

